{"unit_id":"tag:024Z:statement","translation":"固定数域（fields）的一个扩张（extension）<MATH_0001>，其整数（integers）环（rings）为<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>。单射（injection）<MATH_0004>定义了一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>。\n如上所述，使<MATH_0006>在我们的意义下非分歧（unramified）的点（points），对应于使<MATH_0007>在通常意义下非分歧（unramified）的点（points）所成的集合（set）。在通常意义下，<MATH_0008>中的分歧（ramification）轨迹（locus）可以用不同式（different）的消失集（set）来定义；这是<MATH_0009>中的一个理想（ideal）。实际上，不同式（different）正是模（module）<MATH_0010>的零化子（annihilator）。类似地，判别式（discriminant）是<MATH_0011>中的一个理想（ideal），即不同式（different）的范数（norm）。判别式（discriminant）的消失集（set）恰为点（points）的集合（set），这些点属于<MATH_0012>并在<MATH_0013>中发生分歧（ramify）。\n因此，用<MATH_0014>表示补集（complement），它是由不同式（different）在<MATH_0015>中定义的闭子集（closed subset）的补集，我们得到一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0016>，它是非分歧的（unramified）。\n此外，这个态射（morphism）也是平坦的（flat），因为离散赋值环（discrete valuation rings）之间的任意局部同态（local homomorphism）都是平坦的（flat），因此这个态射（morphism）实际上是平展的（<ACCENT_0001>tale）。如果<MATH_0017>是有限（finite）伽罗瓦（Galois）的，则用<MATH_0018>表示补集（complement），它是由判别式（discriminant）在<MATH_0019>中定义的闭子集（closed subset）的补集，我们看到甚至得到有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0020>。因此，这是有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）覆盖（covering）的一个例子。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"数域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"integers","target_term":"整数"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"injection","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"ramification","target_term":"分歧"},{"source_term":"locus","target_term":"轨迹"},{"source_term":"different","target_term":"不同式"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"消失集"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"different","target_term":"不同式"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"annihilator","target_term":"零化子"},{"source_term":"discriminant","target_term":"判别式"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"different","target_term":"不同式"},{"source_term":"norm","target_term":"范数"},{"source_term":"discriminant","target_term":"判别式"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"消失集"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"ramify","target_term":"发生分歧"},{"source_term":"complement","target_term":"补集"},{"source_term":"different","target_term":"不同式"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"discrete valuation rings","target_term":"离散赋值环"},{"source_term":"local homomorphism","target_term":"局部同态"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展的"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"Galois","target_term":"伽罗瓦"},{"source_term":"complement","target_term":"补集"},{"source_term":"discriminant","target_term":"判别式"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"数域","context":"number fields中的域，数的限定在中文中保留；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"固定的数域扩张，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"integers","target_term":"整数","context":"数域的整数环，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环","context":"数域整数环，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"injection","target_term":"单射","context":"原文的域嵌入，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":