{"unit_id":"tag:0250:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面列出一些事实，并给出代数（algebra）章中的参考。\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> 自由（Free）和投射（projective）模（modules）都是平坦的（flat）。这对自由（free）模（modules）显然成立；对投射（projective）模（modules）也成立，因为它们是自由（free）模（modules）的直和项（direct summands），且<MATH_0001>与直和（direct sums）交换（commutes）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 平坦性（Flatness）是局部性质（local property），即<MATH_0002>在<MATH_0003>上平坦（flat），当且仅当<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上平坦（flat），对所有<MATH_0006>均如此。见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0005> 如果<MATH_0007>是平坦（flat）的<MATH_0008>-模（module），且<MATH_0009>是环映射（ring map），则<MATH_0010>是平坦（flat）的<MATH_0011>-模（module）。见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0002>。\n<STRUCT_0006> 有限（Finite）平坦模（flat modules），若在局部环（local rings）上，则是自由的（free）。见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0007> 如果<MATH_0012>是任意环（rings）之间的态射（morphism），则<MATH_0013>平坦（flat），当且仅当诱导映射（maps）<MATH_0014>对所有<MATH_0015>均平坦（flat）。见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0004>。\n<STRUCT_0008> 如果<MATH_0016>是局部环（local rings）之间的局部同态（local homomorphism），则<MATH_0017>平坦（flat），当且仅当它忠实平坦（faithfully flat）。见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0005>。\n<STRUCT_0009> 映射（map）<MATH_0018>，在环（rings）之间，是忠实平坦的（faithfully flat），当且仅当它平坦（flat），且在谱（spectra）上诱导的映射（induced map）是满射（surjective）。见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0006>。\n<STRUCT_0010> 如果<MATH_0019>是诺特局部环（Noetherian local ring），则完备化（completion）<MATH_0020>在<MATH_0021>上忠实平坦（faithfully flat）。见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0007>。\n<STRUCT_0011> 设<MATH_0022>是诺特局部环（Noetherian local ring），<MATH_0023>是<MATH_0024>-模（module）。则<MATH_0025>在<MATH_0026>上平坦（flat），当且仅当<MATH_0027>在<MATH_0028>上平坦（flat）。（将上一条陈述与《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0008>结合。）\n<STRUCT_0012>\n在转入几何范畴（category）之前，我们先给出格罗滕迪克的定理，它提供了构造平坦模（flat modules）的便利方法。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"Free","target_term":"自由"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"投射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"free","target_term":"自由"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"投射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"free","target_term":"自由"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"direct summands","target_term":"直和项"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"local property","target_term":"局部性质"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"Finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"flat modules","target_term":"平坦模"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"free","target_term":"自由的"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"诱导映射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"local homomorphism","target_term":"局部同态"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦的"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"spectra","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"induced map","target_term":"诱导的映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"Noetherian local ring","target_term":"诺特局部环"},{"so