{"unit_id":"tag:0252:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>为诺特局部环（Noetherian local rings）。设<MATH_0003>为局部同态（local homomorphism）。如果<MATH_0004>是有限（finite）的<MATH_0005>-模（module），且作为<MATH_0006>-模（module）是平坦的（flat），并且<MATH_0007>是一个元素（element），使得乘以（multiplication）<MATH_0008>在<MATH_0009>上是单射（injective），则<MATH_0010>也在<MATH_0011>上平坦（flat）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Noetherian local rings","target_term":"诺特局部环"},{"source_term":"local homomorphism","target_term":"局部同态"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"multiplication","target_term":"乘以"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Noetherian local rings","target_term":"诺特局部环","context":"定理的两个环，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"local homomorphism","target_term":"局部同态","context":"定理的环同态，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"模的有限性，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"两处底环不同的模，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的","context":"原模的性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"乘法所用元素，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"multiplication","target_term":"乘以","context":"由指定元素给出的乘法作用，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"在商模上乘法的性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"所得商模的性质，暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
