{"unit_id":"tag:0254:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面我们“回顾”平坦（flat）态射（morphisms）所具有的一些开性（openness）性质。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"openness","target_term":"开性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"所讨论态射的性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所讨论的几何映射，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"openness","target_term":"开性","context":"本节回顾的拓扑性质，暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0255:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为一个态射（morphism），它局部有限型（locally of finite type）。设<MATH_0003>为凝聚（coherent）的<MATH_0004>-模（module）。<MATH_0005>中那些使<MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>上平坦（flat）的点（points）所成的集合（set）是开（open）集（set）。特别地，使<MATH_0008>平坦（flat）的点（points）所成的集合（set）在<MATH_0009>中是开的（open）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"coherent","target_term":"凝聚"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特","context":"底概形的性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"底几何对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"定理的态射，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型","context":"态射的有限型条件，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"coherent","target_term":"凝聚","context":"模的凝聚性，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"所给层模，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"模及态射的平坦性，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"两处平坦性成立的点，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"两处满足条件的点集，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开","context":"开集的性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集","context":"open set中的集合，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开的","context":"最后一处点集的性质，暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
