{"unit_id":"tag:0254:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n研究平坦（flat）态射（morphisms）的一个重要原因是，它们为刻画概形（schemes）的族（family）提供了适当框架，其中参数化（parametrized）由另一个概形（scheme）的点（points）给出。直观地，人们可能认为，任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>都应视为一个族（family），其参数化（parametrized）由<MATH_0002>的点（points）给出。然而，若不对<MATH_0003>施加平坦性（flatness）限制，这个所谓的族（family）中就可能发生十分奇异的现象。例如，我们并不能保证相对维数（relative dimension）（即纤维（fibres）的维数（dimension））在一个族（family）中恒定（constant）。其他数值不变量（numerical invariants），例如希尔伯特多项式（Hilbert polynomial），也可能随纤维（fibre）而异，从一个纤维（fibre）到另一个时发生变化。平坦性（Flatness）阻止这类现象发生，从而为纤维（fibres）提供了某种“连续性（continuity）”。\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"parametrized","target_term":"参数化"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"parametrized","target_term":"参数化"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"relative dimension","target_term":"相对维数"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"恒定"},{"source_term":"numerical invariants","target_term":"数值不变量"},{"source_term":"Hilbert polynomial","target_term":"希尔伯特多项式"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"continuity","target_term":"连续性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"研究对象的平坦性，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"本段开头的映射，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"族中的几何对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"本段四处讨论的参数化对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"parametrized","target_term":"参数化","context":"由底概形的点给出参数，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"给出参数的另一个几何对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"两处给出参数的点，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"任意所给映射，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"施加于态射的限制，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"relative dimension","target_term":"相对维数","context":"族的维数性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维","context":"相对维数定义及最后一句的几何对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数","context":"括号解释中的纤维维数，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"恒定","context":"相对维数在族中不变的性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"numerical invariants","target_term":"数值不变量","context":"除相对维数之外的量，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Hilbert polynomial","target_term":"希尔伯特多项式","context":"所举数值不变量，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维","context":"逐个比较数值不变量的对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"最后一句的性质名称，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"continuity","target_term":"连续性","context":"原文带引号的直观性质，暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
